jobs.description:
Would you like to contribute to flawless mail delivery and are you looking for a flexible part-time job? Become a mail preparer at our client in Assen! In this role, you will be responsible for ensuring that mail is correctly sorted and prepared for dispatch.

As a mail preparer in Assen, you are responsible for accurately sorting incoming mail. You will check addresses and shipping details and use various mail processing machines to handle the mail efficiently. The job requires precision and good physical condition, as you will be working primarily on your feet. You should also be open to working overtime to assist your colleagues during backlogs or busy periods.

What we ask for:

- No minimum educational requirements;
- Precision and attention to detail;
- Enthusiastic and motivated attitude;
- You speak either Dutch or English;
- Availability for 3 days, between Monday to Thursday.

Vacaturebeschrijving
   For our client in Spijkenisse, we are looking for an all-round warehouse operator. In this role, you'll take on a variety of tasks in a day shift schedule. You'll earn a gross monthly salary up to €3,000 and will be offered a direct contract with our client.
Wij bieden - A gross monthly salary between €2,600 - €3,000;
 -  A full-time job in the day shift (08:00 - 16:30);
 - Direct contract with the employer;
 - Being part of a growing international organization;
 - Travel allowance;
 - 25 vacation days and 8% holiday allowance.

FunctieomschrijvingAs a warehouse operator, you ensure a smooth logistics process. You unload containers with boxes weighing 15 to 20 kilos, process goods into the WMS system, and pick orders using a narrow-aisle truck and hand scanner. After picking, you package the orders, label them with barcodes, and prepare them for shipment. Additionally, you assist in printing company logos on clothing. This diverse position requires physical effort and attention to detail.
Je werkplekOur client is a Greek organization specialized in personal protective equipment. They design, produce, and distribute their products to a wide range of customers. Their Dutch warehouse, located in Spijkenisse, currently employs six people. The working environment is informal and based on mutual trust.
Functie-eisen - Proficiency in English;
 - Full-time availability;
 - Minimum of 1 year experience in logistics;
 - Experience with narrow-aisle trucks and forklifts is a plus.

van nes + plaisierWhen you apply through van nes + plaisier, you have an edge over other candidates. In addition to your CV, we create a personalized profile and highlight to our client why you are the ideal fit. We also actively help you find the job that suits you best!
Solliciteren?Mocht je willen solliciteren op deze vacature, kan dat door te klikken op de 'solliciteren' button. Voor vragen kan je contact opnemen met Emma de Groot via edgroot@vannesenplaisier.n
